[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891847\">5050B32</a>\n                                           (left and right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/2892256\">7055A18</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Remove the motor protective boot.</p><p>2. Remove the intermittent device.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035346.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the intermittent\ndevice is not damaged and, if necessary, conduct an electrical test\non it.</p><p>Refit the intermittent device.</p><p>Refit the motor protective boot.</p><p><a href=\"#/2892256\">7055A18</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2891847\">5050B32</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p>Check the operation of the windscreen wiper.</p>"]]